            },
            "description": "Visit workspace shell + overview tab: client header, allergies, progress, summary widgets, care plan essentials."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete visit details",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/employee-app/visits/{{jobId}}/details",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["employee-app", "visits", "{{jobId}}", "details"]
            },
            "description": "Single bootstrap snapshot: shell, overview, tasks, MAR, observations, log, body-map.\n\nNo `tabs` array (mobile tab bar is hardcoded).\n\n`shell.location` is only `{ latitude, longitude, allowedRadiusMeters }` for client geofence. Service-user coords for maps remain on `shell.client.latitude` / `longitude`.\n\n`data.observations` is backend-owned: `catalog` (picker), `definitionsByTypeCode` (forms/ranges), `unableReasons`, plus required/optional/suggested/recorded lists."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Check in",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identityConfirmed\": true,\n  \"method\": \"GPS\",\n  \"latitude\": 51.5074,\n  \"longitude\": -0.1278,\n  \"accuracyMeters\": 12.4,\n  \"locationCapturedAt\": \"2026-08-03T08:01:12.345Z\",\n  \"deviceRecordedAt\": \"2026-08-03T08:01:13.000Z\",\n  \"isMockedLocation\": false,\n  \"withinArea\": true,\n  \"distanceMeters\": 18,\n  \"timingStatus\": \"late\",\n  \"timingExceptionReasonCode\": \"TRAVEL_OR_TRAFFIC\",\n  \"timingExceptionNotes\": \"Traffic on A-road\",\n  \"welfareOutcomeId\": \"seen-ok\",\n  \"personSeen\": true,\n  \"accessViaKeySafe\": false,\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"visit-checkin-{{jobId}}-demo\"\n}"
            },
